    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεξ-ορμάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set out, start earlier,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιᾷ ἡμέρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.13.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				46.37
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πόλεμον π. τῆς θεοῦ βουλήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rush out before the time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				587b1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be stimulated first,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν διαστολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					9.78
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, prob. ibid.</div>
